Z||000003||Raydar||11-07-2001||07:55 PM||||In 88 and maybe late 87, there was a company transplanting 2.2 turbo motors into Fieros. This was a "dealer" option, supposedly sanctioned by Pontiac. The company doing the conversions was "Redshift", or something like that. They still make Honda mod parts.<BR>If I remember correctly, there were only 7 of these Fieros ever made. <BR>If the e-bay guy is selling a V-6, it's BS.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
